  "notes": "Deklarasi viewport dan focus samples; tidak mengukur DOM glyph/ikon atau lintasan semua objek. Audit render wajib. S04–05: envelope viewport saja; modal Windows sengaja overlap parent, collision internal/UI/cursor belum diuji. Sampel kontrol pada frame sebelum aksi: S04 dan S05. Kamera fixed untuk UI; topology zoom masih envelope saja. S06–08: protected scene envelopes and subtitle bounds; CTA fade reuses frozen prior scene. Envelope does not prove each vector sublayer collision or actual DOM glyph. Cover group scale 0.87963 / 0.8802083; visual review still required. New protected groups: S06 UI and topology, S07 bubble body reflow (same smoothstep keys; text intentionally within bubble), S08 title/monitors/printer. Cables and print packet intentional path, detailed inner geometry not declared; fade treated as composite envelope while old art dissolves. V4: new typography safe envelopes; demo and existing global tracks shifted. Bounds are declarations, not native glyph measurement. Explicit legacy style migration: visual wrapper scale 0.8, cover 0.8; guide separate. Typography is its own spoken text (no duplicate guide). V10: envelope hook diperluas untuk tanda tanya dan coral; demo +112 screen px, headline di atas, S02 smooth kembali selama 78f (36f awal mengikuti referensi). Bounds deklaratif; verifikasi native glyph/gap pending. S02 V13 headline envelopes; S03 translated host/Run/UI viewport and source world targets; world sample viewport +128px during all existing focus samples, final 24f UI settles to original S04 pose; no camera retime. Legacy envelopes contain blank pixels, not DOM bounds. Six outlines are child controls of original UI, not page borders. Native visual verification pending."
